<title>CANADA: Bank of Nova Scotia Q4 shr sharply higher.</title>
<headline>Bank of Nova Scotia Q4 shr sharply higher.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>fourth quarter ended Oct. 31</p>
<p>			    1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			 C$1.08		   C$0.88</p>
<p> Net			283,000		  230,000</p>
<p> Assets	     157,261,000	    147,189,000</p>
<p> Deposits	   117,894,000	    111,345,000</p>
<p> Loans		104,733,000	     97,088,000</p>
<p>		     12  MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			 C$4.08		   C$3.38</p>
<p> Net		    1,069,000		  876,000</p>
<p>	 (All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>-- Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100</p>
